{"4240130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eliim Princes", "steam_appid": 4240130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliim Princes is a third-person single-player adventure game where you control Stella and her friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete tasks, find people, and solve puzzles to progress.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[b]<strong>◆Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stella and her friends search for the fragments of the legendary jewel, the Rainbow Star, to defeat the dark monster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But then, a dangerous and powerful enemy attacks Stella and her friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240130/extras/7c6e1c9dc1926413ad95d92a3a303881.avif?t=1785984042\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[b]<strong>◆Operating Instructions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with WASD key/left stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash with SHIFT key/X button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump with SPACE key/A button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the viewpoint with left hold and right stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click/Y button to fly or cancel flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Flying is not allowed inside the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack with F key/LB (3 consecutive attacks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use G key/RB to cast magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak/investigate/pick up with E key/B button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the button by clicking,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or select with D-pad and press with A button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open 3 types of items, hats, equipment, and status with characteristics/equipment items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an important item and I have it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the character with the character switch button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save in settings, change volume, sound effects, and camera perspective</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[b]◆About video streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and live commentary are permitted.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eliim Princes is a third-person single-player adventure game where you control Stella and her friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete tasks, find people, and solve puzzles to progress.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[b]<strong>◆Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stella and her friends search for the fragments of the legendary jewel, the Rainbow Star, to defeat the dark monster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But then, a dangerous and powerful enemy attacks Stella and her friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240130/extras/7c6e1c9dc1926413ad95d92a3a303881.avif?t=1785984042\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[b]<strong>◆Operating Instructions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with WASD key/left stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash with SHIFT key/X button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump with SPACE key/A button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the viewpoint with left hold and right stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click/Y button to fly or cancel flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Flying is not allowed inside the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack with F key/LB (3 consecutive attacks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use G key/RB to cast magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak/investigate/pick up with E key/B button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the button by clicking,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or select with D-pad and p